{"4161140":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Finding Polka","steam_appid":4161140,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I have friends I want to see<\/strong><br><strong>I have family I want to see<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frendy lives a peaceful life with her beloved dog Jazz.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, in front of a flower shop, she spots a dog that looks just like Polka,<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the dog Frendy had in her childhood.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before she knew it, Frendy and Jazz were chasing after it ー<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4161140\/extras\/a88ca2d04432034b3738c5c64e1b4e2d.webp?t=1795613305\" width=192 height=63 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy interactive adventure where you find Polka somewhere on the map.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple world drawn in ballpoint pen welcomes you with playful humor.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4161140\/extras\/8b44ee8524aed41343586b260b56f17e.poster.avif?t=1795613305\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4161140\/extras\/8b44ee8524aed41343586b260b56f17e.webm?t=1795613305\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4161140\/extras\/8b44ee8524aed41343586b260b56f17e.mp4?t=1795613305\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique characters await you at the end of your adventure!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can high-five them and become friends.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friends are reliable allies who will help and cheer you on when you face trouble.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4161140\/extras\/7e8654727ea1c24d4d7bd64545cbe383.poster.avif?t=1795613305\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4161140\/extras\/7e8654727ea1c24d4d7bd64545cbe383.webm?t=1795613305\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4161140\/extras\/7e8654727ea1c24d4d7bd64545cbe383.mp4?t=1795613305\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No dialogue, no spoken words. The characters convey their feelings through expressions, subtle gestures, and sound effects.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even without words, they laugh, they get surprised, and they become friends ー<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4161140\/extras\/40ba00451e9ed74459027cc55fe5b456.webp?t=1795613305\" width=344 height=63 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various mini games are available throughout the area, including putt-putt golf, whac-a-mole, soccer shootout, boat racing, watermelon splitting, and volleyball. These are not required for story progression and are optional side activities you can enjoy freely.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop play